## Proposed Changes

### Synthesis & DSP Engine
We will create a dedicated SSNN engine namespace containing the spiking model, the FFT analyzer, and the 8 synthesis engines.

#### [NEW] [engine.ts](file:///d:/Proyectos/StrudelAI-main/StrudelAI-main/src/lib/ssnn/engine.ts)
Core SSNN class executing the Leaky-Integrate-and-Fire model, maintaining membrane potential, handling threshold spikes, weight matrices, and routing spike outputs to synthesis voices.

#### [NEW] [dsp.ts](file:///d:/Proyectos/StrudelAI-main/StrudelAI-main/src/lib/ssnn/dsp.ts)
Implementation of the 8 synthesis models:
- **Pulse**: Electronic component model (555 timer, transistor clicks, capacitors, relays).
- **Modal**: Wood percussions (resonant bandpass filters on impulse exciters).
- **SYNaptic**: FM synthesis modulated by neuron spikes.
- **Granular**: 32-layer granular wavetable with real-time transient detection.
- **FM**: Traditional frequency modulation synthesis.
- **Comb**: Physical-modeling resonator with feedback delay.
- **Tape**: Light Tape Looper (32-layer delay line with per-layer offsets).
- **Arpeg**: Chord progression mapper with Scala scale tuning.

#### [NEW] [fft.ts](file:///d:/Proyectos/StrudelAI-main/StrudelAI-main/src/lib/ssnn/fft.ts)
FFT analyser and weight mapping tool. Measures spectral profile of incoming audio and updates the SNN connection weights.

