- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build` to verify TS compilation and bundle integrity.
- Run `npm run test:music-quality` to check synth engines do not degrade background audio.

### Manual Verification
- Launch the server with `npm run dev` and navigate to the SSNN workspace.
- Interact with sliders (`Tau`, `bernoulli`, `Sweight`) to verify they change network visualization dynamically.
- Enable `SpecListen` and feed audio (microphone/audio file) to verify weights adjust in real-time.
- Select different synthesis engines (Pulse, Modal, SYNaptic) and trigger notes to check audio generation.
- Check that the preset bank works correctly and saves parameters locally.
